{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1321121001:1":{"text":"Have you seen Natasha? She's the one who requested to make a prayer here at sunrise.","source_cn":"请问你有看到娜塔莎吗？就是要在日出时向女神祈祷的那位小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4319C06D2CCB3ADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321121002:1":{"text":"Oh, that lady. She just went out from the <style=\"highlight\">back exit</style>. She seemed to be looking for something, but I'm not sure what exactly.","source_cn":"噢，那位小姐啊。她刚刚从<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x524D7DA058DB3085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321121003:1":{"text":"I expect she'll be back soon. I hope she won't run into any of the beasts that occasionally roam around the back hill...","source_cn":"不过她出去也有一段时间了，应该快回来了吧？后山上偶尔会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660A599A318E7C50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321121004:1":{"text":"Beasts?! That's too dangerous!","source_cn":"——野兽？！这也太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04030371149F302A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321121005:1":{"text":"We've got to check on h